        "body": "<!-- proofline:finding-series=01a202cd-8441-74a3-a929-acf7331fa4af -->\n**Warning** \u00b7 The README worker leaves the newly scheduled report pending\n\nThis change schedules reports on `report-dispatch`, but the [`README.md`](https://github.com/Pratik8445/bench-run-greptile/blob/fcb0c2a94196532d3d49af8d99d731474b00c1c2/README.md?plain=1#L6-L8) worker command still selects `reports`.\n\nOn a fresh database, the documented worker delivers zero reports and leaves the due report pending.\n\nUpdate the worker example in [`README.md`](https://github.com/Pratik8445/bench-run-greptile/blob/fcb0c2a94196532d3d49af8d99d731474b00c1c2/README.md?plain=1#L6-L8) to use `--queue report-dispatch`.\n\n[View finding in Proofline](https://proofline.sh/orgs/by-id/01a202a0-cd61-7684-99bc-53c775b0de50/reviews/01a202cc-6d1f-7761-8492-8f9a78aaed00/findings/01a202cd-8443-7304-9a96-cb407cf1dafd)",
